msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "The amount of time during which the strokes will be kept unmerged. When a stroke becomes old enough, Skissa will try to merge it"
msgstr "An méid ama a choinneofar na strócanna gan chumasc. Nuair a bheidh stróc sean go leor, déanfaidh Skissa iarracht é a chumasc"

msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "The number of last strokes that Skissa will not merge (even if they are old enough)"
msgstr "Líon na strócanna deireanacha nach gcuirfidh Skissa le chéile (fiú má tá siad sean go leor)"

msgid "Cumulative Undo allows Skissa to merge undo actions and make undo history cleaner. Skissa will still keep a few latest actions unmerged according to \"Wait before merging strokes\" and \"Exclude last strokes from merge\" options. Whenever an action gets outdated using the time limit and this action is not excluded using \"Exclude last strokes from merge\", Skissa will try  to merge this action into a group. The groups are formed using \"Max group strokes delay\" and \"Max group duration\" options."
msgstr "Le Cealaigh Carnach, is féidir le Skissa gníomhartha cealaithe a chumasc agus stair an chealaithe a dhéanamh níos glaine. Coinneoidh Skissa roinnt gníomhartha is déanaí gan chumasc de réir na roghanna \"Fan sula ndéantar strócanna a chumasc\" agus \"Eisiamh na strócanna deireanacha ó chumasc\". Aon uair a théann gníomh as dáta ag baint úsáide as an teorainn ama agus nach ndéantar an gníomh seo a eisiamh ag baint úsáide as \"Eisiamh na strócanna deireanacha ó chumasc\", déanfaidh Skissa iarracht an gníomh seo a chumasc i ngrúpa. Cruthaítear na grúpaí ag baint úsáide as na roghanna \"Moill uasta strócanna grúpa\" agus \"Fad uasta grúpa\"."

