msgid "<html><head/><body><h1 align=\"center\"><b>Your Rights</b></h1><p>Skissa is released under the GNU General Public License (version 3 or any later version).</p><p>This license grants people a number of freedoms:</p><ul><li>You are free to use Skissa, for any purpose</li><li>You are free to distribute Skissa</li><li>You can study how Skissa works and change it</li><li>You can distribute changed versions of Skissa</li></ul><p>The Krita Foundation and its projects on krita.org are <b>committed</b> to preserving Krita as free software.</p><h1 align=\"center\">Your artwork</h1><p>What you create with Skissa is your sole property. All your artwork is free for you to use as you like.</p><p>That means that Skissa can be used commercially, for any purpose. There are no restrictions whatsoever.</p><p>Krita’s GNU GPL license guarantees you this freedom. Nobody is ever permitted to take it away, in contrast to trial or educational versions of commercial software that will forbid your work in commercial situations.</p><br/><hr/><pre>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><h1 align=\"center\"><b>Do Chearta</b></h1><p>Scaoiltear Skissa faoin gCeadúnas Poiblí Ginearálta GNU (leagan 3 nó aon leagan níos déanaí).</p><p>Tugann an ceadúnas seo roinnt saoirsí do dhaoine:</p><ul><li>Tá tú saor chun Skissa a úsáid, chun aon chríche</li><li>Tá tú saor chun Skissa a dháileadh</li><li>Is féidir leat staidéar a dhéanamh ar an gcaoi a n-oibríonn Skissa agus é a athrú</li><li>Is féidir leat leaganacha athraithe de Skissa a dháileadh</li></ul><p>Tá Fondúireacht Skissa agus a tionscadail ar krita.org <b>tiomanta</b> do Skissa a chaomhnú mar bhogearraí saor in aisce.</p><h1 align=\"center\">Do shaothar ealaíne</h1><p>Is leatsa an t-aon mhaoin a chruthaíonn tú le Skissa. Tá do shaothar ealaíne go léir saor in aisce duit le húsáid mar is mian leat.</p><p>Ciallaíonn sé sin gur féidir Skissa a úsáid go tráchtála, chun aon chríche. Níl aon srianta ar bith ann.</p><p>Ráthaíonn ceadúnas GNU GPL Skissa an tsaoirse seo duit. Ní cheadaítear d'aon duine é a bhaint díot riamh, i gcodarsnacht le leaganacha trialach nó oideachasúla de bhogearraí tráchtála a chuirfidh cosc ar d'obair i gcásanna tráchtála.</p><br/><hr/><pre>"

